sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + single-swamp-node; DECISIONS R3 (server key by name, no root password in intent), 5 (swamp role SSH identity), always-run cleanup.
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as DB server Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: database:user:create<br/>{connection: shop, user: report}
  Note over GW: Validate, check conflicts<br/>record task database_user.create
  GW->>SW: Store user password<br/>database-user-create-intent-5123
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-database-user-create
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5123
  SW->>N: Copy action scripts<br/>@swamp/ssh · swamp role identity
  opt PostgreSQL replication user
    SW->>N: Check wal_level=logical<br/>user_wal.py
  end
  SW->>N: Create or update login<br/>vault.get server key, user key
  SW->>N: Replace database grants<br/>user_grant.py in container
  Note over SW: Remove /tmp scripts<br/>always-run step, pass or fail
  alt every action exits 0
    N-->>SW: exit 0 per action
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event + outputs
    Note over GW: Record user, privileges<br/>DatabaseUser upsert
  else an action fails
    N--xSW: exit 1, step output
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>…user_create_outcome_unknown
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5123
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
